// Defect 3: a generated portrait (behind "Generate AI Portrait") is a new image — pose, framing,
// background and lighting all differ from the source — so ComparePreview's slider would imply a
// pixel correspondence that does not exist. This is a separate component rather than a second mode
// on ComparePreview, so that interaction model never has to represent "there is no shared grid this
// time": instead of a divider, holding the control shows the original in full; releasing returns to
